#: tim_clock/1
msgctxt "Tag Nom d'objet (MAJUSCULES)"
msgid "CLOCK"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/12
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You see a slim, dainty gentleman in a well-tailored suit. He's absorbed in the ticking of a fancy pocketwatch, but it's the feline ears on his head that most catch your attention."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/20
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A tail sprouts from just above his backside, moving back and forth in time with the watch."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/28
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Tick... tick... tick."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Tock... tock... tock?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Lyme disease is no joke."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>Don't.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Do not taint the perfection of the clock with your disgusting imitation."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "...what?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "No, never mind. I don't want to know."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Why have you come?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I don't see 'interruption to meditations on the beauty of time' on the schedule."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I live here, dude."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is 'be a total dick to a stranger' on there?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I just wanted to appreciate the beauty of time or whatever with you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I am not disputing that!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/c-4/21
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But you are NOT on the SCHEDULE!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/c-4/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Do you understand?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "How crass! Of course it isn't!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But perhaps I shall have to pencil in 'have day ruined by RUFFIAN.'"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-0/c-6/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Oh, well. I can certainly make time for that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Perhaps you do not know this, as so few are as attuned to time as I am."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But punctuality is of the UTMOST importance."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "So if you wish to speak to me, you must make an APPOINTMENT."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is emphasizing every third word part of the routine too?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you some kind of VIP or something?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah I'm not doing that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You mock my elocution?!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/c-7/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I speak with ELEGANCE! PRECISION! TIMELINESS!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "If VIP stands for Very Intelligent and Punctual then, yes yes I am. Ahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-1/c-9/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I'm afraid you don't have a choice!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "IF you wish to make my acquaintance PROPERLY you will return with an appointment."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you gonna at least tell me your name before I do that?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-2/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't even know who you are yet."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-2/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "And who am I getting an appointment with exactly?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Sweet heavenly hours, I was so busy reprimanding you I forgot to introduce myself."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Not that you didn't deserve it for breaking from the schedule, but it is no excuse."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Timothy. Timothy Timepiece, at your service."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess that explains the obsession with time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It most certainly does not!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "We should ALL be obsessed with the beauty and perfection of time!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "The... safety of it, really."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/31
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "As long as one abides by the schedule, nothing can be out of place."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/39
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You WILL abide by the schedule, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Say shhhedule one more time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/47/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course I'll respect your schedule."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/47/c-0/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You mock my speech!!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/47/c-0/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Desist at once!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/47/c-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's the big deal?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/47/c-0/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What's the 'big deal'?! The big deal is that ANY deviations from the schedule will result in disaster!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/47/c-0/32/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I SHAN'T elaborate further!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-3/c-13/47/c-1/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Excellent. I thank you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I will see you at noon sharp, and we can speak then."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Do NOT be early, do NOT be late, and do NOT try to see me at another time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "If you do..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-4/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Calamity. Catastrophe. Untimeliness."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_first/0/g-4/35
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "See you then and not a moment before."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/0/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What are you doing here?! I TOLD you to come at noon sharp!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/1/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What are you doing here?! I TOLD you to come at 3pm sharp!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/2/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What are you doing here?! I TOLD you to come at 9pm sharp!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/3/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What are you doing here?! I TOLD you to come at 9am sharp!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/6
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "NO NO NO!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well I'm here now. So what?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh come on, don't be mad."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry, I'll leave."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "YOU HAVE CHOSEN THE WORST TIME TO COME!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I DEMAND YOU LEAVE AT ONCE!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I AM BEYOND MAD!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "IF YOU HAVE ANY WISH TO RETAIN SOME RELATIONSHIP WITH ME YOU WILL LEAVE AT ONCE!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "GOOD! GO!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-2/15/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "AND DO NOT COME BACK UNTIL NOON!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-2/16/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "AND DO NOT COME BACK UNTIL 3 PM!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-2/17/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "AND DO NOT COME BACK UNTIL 9 PM!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-2/18/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "AND DO NOT COME BACK UNTIL 9 AM!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-2/21/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright. Um, bye-"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/c-2/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "GOOOO!!!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I do not understand! WHY DO YOU STAND HERE STARING AT ME!?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I TOLD YOU, I'M N... N... NYaaAAA..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/19/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "'Nya?'"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "RUN! FOR GOD'S SAKE!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/c-3/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy falls forwards onto his hands and knees, arching his back like a frightened cat. He almost looks like a Halloween decoration."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/c-3/29
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He convulses, as though something terrible were ripping through his body."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/c-3/40
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's awful to see—it reminds you of the werewolf movies you've seen... but there's something feline about it all."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/c-3/48
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Nnnnnggghh..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/c-3/68
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He stills on the ground, and then he yawns and stretches, as though nothing strange had happened at all."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-0/c-3/79
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Mmm... so sleepy, nya. Maybe time for a cat nap."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-1/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Timothy?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-1/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-1/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You seem... different."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-1/3/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What the hell happened to you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Hmm?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "What, this? Does it upset you, master?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-2/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Master?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You own the clock, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-2/c-8/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "That makes you Timmy's owner, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-2/c-8/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You don't like it when Timmy calls you 'master'?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It makes me uncomfortable."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's cute..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Cut that out."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Timmy never wants to make you uncomfortable..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-9/15 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-11/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The catboy brings his hands to rest just under his chin, his eyes growing larger and shinier in an almost cartoon-like fashion."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-9/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will remember not to call you 'master' in the future, nya!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-9/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Good. Thank you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-9/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "'welcome."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will remember that, master."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-11/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Has Timmy displeased you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-11/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy sowwy... <w>uwu... </w>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-11/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Uh... thanks."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-3/c-11/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Mmm, 'welcome."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-4/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Can you please just explain what the hell is going on?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-4/c-12/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "It's simple, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-4/c-12/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy has a condition. It's tied to the clock."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-4/c-12/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy spends half the day like this."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-5/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "An adorable catboy?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-5/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A nightmare freak?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-5/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Like this?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-5/c-13/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Purr-cisely!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-5/c-14/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "N-nya-ghtmare freak?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-5/c-14/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Not nice..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-5/c-15/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Like this... just purrfect."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-6/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy loves himself just the way he is... but when he's back to boring suit form, he hates himself."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-6/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "All he cares about is shhhhedyule, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-6/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're... he's... so worked up about appointments and scheduling so no one will see you like this?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-6/c-16/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-6/c-16/15/b/1 tim_clock/timmy_worse/0/c-0/29/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Master is so smart..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-6/c-16/16/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You're such a smart human."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy yawns and stretches, curling up on the rug in front of you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Maybe you come back and play with Timmy later?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/16
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "So sleepy... transformation takes a lot out of Timmy..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you care what time I come back?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I never want to see you in this terrible form again."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Enjoy your nap."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-17/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy doesn't care, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-17/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Just come when <i>Timothy</i> tells you not to."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-17/29/b/1 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-18/32/b/1 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-19/29/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is here before or after noon."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-17/30/b/1 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-18/33/b/1 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-19/30/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is here before or after 3pm."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-17/31/b/1 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-18/34/b/1 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-19/31/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is here before or after 9pm."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-17/32/b/1 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-18/35/b/1 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-19/32/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is here before or after 9am."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-17/35 tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-19/35
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Nap time now..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-18/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "So mean, nya... you hurt Timmy's feelings."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-18/24
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "If you don't wanna see Timmy just come when <i>Timothy</i> tells you to."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-18/38
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Nap time now... bye meanie."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-19/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "I will, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_first/0/g-7/c-19/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "If you want to see Timmy again just come when <i>Timothy</i> tells you not to."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/6
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Hmm... almost late... almost..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/14/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Did I make it? Is it alright now?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/15/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If that's all it takes to devastate you it was a matter of time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm sorry, Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why don't we just pretend it never happened?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Yes indeed, you're just in time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Thank you for coming on TIME this time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "We very nearly skirted disaster. You must promise me to NEVER do that again."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/c-0/47
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Unfortunately for me you know my secret now."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/c-0/55
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You simply had to be tardy, didn't you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_second/0/c-0/63
msgctxt "Timothy"
