msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Or maybe you just show him that you really respect his schedule by not making him late for things, or giving him extra chores when he wakes again."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Mmm hmm. Mhm. Timmy hears your words."
