#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/39/c-1/39
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy looks around the room, before his gaze settles on a glass on the table. He moves quickly, knocking it to the floor so that it shatters."
