#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/39/c-1/63/c-0/31
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "If you want to say sorry, find Timmy NOT at midnight."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/39/c-1/63/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You see, nya? That's just how it is."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-0/21/c-0/15/c-0/39/c-1/63/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He yawns and stretches lazily, as though he'd just done something strenuous and exhausting."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy wouldn't have to worry about mean old Timothy's opinion if he would just accept the cutest version of himself."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "How do you stop worrying then?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just distract yourself with something else."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I couldn't tell you... I have real bad anxiety."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's something you'll have to figure out on your own."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Distract myself with something else..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Like what?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You could try a nap. You seem to like those."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "So Timmy will go to sleep whenever he worries too much about Timothy?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-0/23/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, that sounds helpful."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-0/23/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Hmm... if you say so..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "What's the point of you if you have problems and no solutions, nya!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Look, I'm just saying I'm still working on that myself."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Well work harder!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-1/15/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You think I'd be here talking to a were-catboy clock if I had my shit figured out?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-1/15/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "...touche..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-2/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy doesn't LIKE figuring things out! Too much work..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-1/29/c-2/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Too much thinking makes Timmy sleepy... (yawn)"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-2/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "So Timmy is purrfect, but less purrfect than a timepiece?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-2/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is getting a lot of mixed signals here, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-2/29
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "If Timmy is not as purrfect as a dumb old clock then Timothy will never accept him..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_perfection/0/c-2/37
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "So Timmy must become more perfect... somehow... (yawn)"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy has too much on his mind, nya... need a nap."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Maybe you come back and see Timmy again?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/16/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will be in his cutest form NOT at noon."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/16/b/9
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "If you want to see Timmy when he's not fun... come at noon."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/17/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will be in his cutest form NOT at 3pm."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/17/b/9
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "If you want to see Timmy when he's not fun... come at 3pm."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/18/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will be in his cutest form NOT at 9pm."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/18/b/9
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "If you want to see Timmy when he's not fun... come at 9pm."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/19/b/1
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will be in his cutest form NOT at 9am."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/19/b/9
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "If you want to see Timmy when he's not fun... come at 9am."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_join1/0/23/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll see..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/6
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy is just putting the finishing touches on polishing a pocketwatch. When he sees you he waves you over, setting the watch aside and pocketing the cleaning cloth."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/14
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "There you are, just on time!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/22
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I must say, I'm absolutely chuffed to see how timely you've been."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/33
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You're right on schedule; I was just polishing some of my timekeepers."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/41
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Would you care to join me?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd rather swallow glass."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/51/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Well this must be my birthday...!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-0/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Capital! Have a seat, darling."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-1/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "W-what!? That was NOT an option!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-1/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "No, no. Calm yourself Timothy. Think of time... order..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-1/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Tick... tock... tick... tock..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-1/43
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Whew. Nothing better for one's nerves than the steady ticking of the clock."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-1/51
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "That was unpleasant. But you need my help, and I have agreed to share my wisdom with you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-1/59
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "So let us start again."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-2/18/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I didn't realize I was going to be given such a gift..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-2/18/c-0/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Ahahaha! Oh, aren't you clever."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-2/18/c-0/21
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Yes yes, time <i>IS</i> a gift, is it not?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/c-2/18/c-0/29
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "There is no greater feeling than knowing everything is in its place and all is according to schedule."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Now when last we spoke, we discussed the importance of what?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "TARDINESS!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-3/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "PRECISELY!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-3/27
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Nothing better. Nothing more important."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-4/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "NO!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-4/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Sweet Father Time, how could THAT be what you took away from our conversation!?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-4/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I say again TIMELINESS!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-5/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Time..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-5/21
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy stares at you, as though waiting for something."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-5/29
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "...liness. Timeliness."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-0/c-5/37
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Well, halfway there. You almost had it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "The biggest lesson here is that time, above all else, is the first thing you must consider when it comes to love."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But there are of course, other things to consider."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Having a schedule for your date is imperative to ensure you are using every moment with your lover correctly!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You schedule every minute of your dates?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're so right, Time King."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Even during sex?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "EXACTLY!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I am, aren't I? Ahaha."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Why must you say it so disdainfully?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "There is NOTHING more arousing than an orderly, efficiently planned date."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Picture this, if you will."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You and your date arrive at your dinner reservation EXACTLY on time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Your date says to you, 'darling, what's on the agenda?'"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You say to them, 'we have approximately ten minutes to review the menu and engage in small talk.'"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "They can only moan in needful appreciation for your immaculate scheduling."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Is that really what you think would happen?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm aroused just thinking about it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I've never been more turned off in my life."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What I think? It's what I <i>KNOW</i> would happen."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Why, it has happened on every single date I've ever been on!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're still single now because...?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh, okay."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sounds sexy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>I AM SIMPLY TOO BUSY TO DATE AT THE MOMENT!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<w>I AM NOT THE ONE WHO NEEDS HELP HERE!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "If you say so."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-0/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<w>I DO!</w>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-1/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Yes, well. Anyway."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-9/23/c-2/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It is... oh, it is."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Perhaps we have more in common than I realized..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-2/c-11/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Well the feeling is mutual—how distasteful!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "At any rate, scheduling your entire date down to the minute is not only efficient, but an excellent bonding experience for any couple."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "So let us practice now."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You have asked me on a date, and we have both arrived on time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "As we are seated for dinner, I look deeply into your eyes and ask you about tonight's agenda."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You say?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I begin to explain the history of pocketwatches to you in great detail."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I ask the waiter when they're bringing the bread basket."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I read off a meticulously planned timetable for the evening in increments of ten minutes."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-12/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "While that is <i>VERY</i> attractive, I'm afraid it's not quite ideal."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-12/21
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<w>SCHEDULE,</w> darling.<w>SCHEDULE.</w>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-12/29
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But fear not—my schedule has allotted you another chance to get it right."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-13/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Bread? Bread cannot keep time!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-13/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Are you mad!?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-13/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You must give me the <i>SCHEDULE</i> for the evening!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-13/40
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Let us try again with another scenario... and please, do better this time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-14/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>Me-ow... </i> I have never been so attracted to another."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-3/c-14/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Excellent. Truly excellent."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Surprise, our date has gone swimmingly, and I have invited you to another activity!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But your schedule has not accounted for this unexpected excursion!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Horror of horrors... what do you do?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I bid you good night, and tell you we'll do this another day."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I slap you for daring to disrespect the <i>SCHEDULE</i> and my time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hurriedly rearrange my schedule to accommodate."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/c-15/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Exactly! As lovely as our date has been, one cannot deviate from the schedule!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/c-15/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>TERRIBLE</i> things happen when one deviates from the schedule..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_third/0/g-4/c-16/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "No! We cannot enforce time under threat of violence!"
msgstr ""

