#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-3/c-10/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Precisely, yes!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-3/c-10/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "A proper pocket watch must be regularly tended to with gentle, loving hands."
