msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're saying I should be high-maintenance?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "So you're making your life harder for no reason."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-13/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It's all quite simple, my dear! If you raise the standard of care for yourself, whether it be from romantic or platonic relationships..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-13/21
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "The quality of caring you receive will, in turn, be much higher!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-14/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Precisely!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-14/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "When you make the rules around interacting with you complex and difficult, only those worth bothering will be able to adhere to them."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-14/32/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That doesn't really sound like good advice to me, Timothy..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-14/32/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Aha! I'll keep that in mind!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-14/32/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Pish posh! It's perfectly excellent advice!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-14/32/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Trust me, I'm an EXPERT!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-15/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "How dare you! I am <i>ENRICHING</i> my life by forcing myself to spend more time with my pocket watches!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-15/21
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "A clock does not choose the easy path, or he is no clock at all!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-5/c-15/29
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I am ENRICHED by the fact that I must spend hours of my days carefully checking each and every one of my pocket watches!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy looks over at the watch in your hand, as though suddenly realizing you're still holding it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/11
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "There now, that'll do."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/19
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You can just set that down there."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/27
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Gently, please..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/38/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Drop it immediately.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/39/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Hand it to him instead.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "<i>Set it down by the other watches.</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What the hell d'you think you're doing!? You great blundering buffoon!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy snatches up the pocket watch, inspecting it carefully. His face is a mask of horror and fury."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/35
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You've CRACKED IT, YOU CLUMSY... DISCOURTEOUS..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't be mad, I'm sorry."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Do you have any insults not last used in the 1800's?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "IT'S FAR TOO LATE FOR THAT, YOU BUTTERFINGERED BRICKHEAD!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I HAVE NOTHING FOR YOU, YOU GREAT WATCH-DESTROYING NINCOMPOOP!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/c-1/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "BEGONE!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/g-0/0/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Alright..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/g-0/0/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Fine."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/g-0/0/c-0/7 tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-16/46/g-0/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You don't deserve to stand in my presence again! But if you MUST you see me again at 9 AM...."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-17/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You hold the watch out to Timothy instead. He sets his down and takes it from you, his fingers brushing yours in the process."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-17/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For one long moment, you both look at each other, a pregnant pause stretching between you. What is he thinking?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-17/35
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He finally seems to snap out of it, smiling at you before he takes the watch from you and sets it down gently with the other cleaned ones."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-17/43
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Thank you... your care is noted and appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-6/c-18/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Thank you. Your help and courtesy are most appreciated."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You and I have been talking for some time now about these things."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I hope you have gotten something from these little chats of ours?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Not really."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You've been a huge help, thank you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I did... but spending time with you has meant the most to me."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-19/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Ah. Well... that is a shame."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-19/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Perhaps you have simply been unprepared for the sort of firm but fair, realistic advice a timepiece like myself can offer."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-19/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Yes, I've seen much over the years... but it is little use to you if you're in no place to receive it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-19/40
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I accept that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-20/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I am pleased to hear it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-20/21
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I have seen much and more over the years... but I've rarely been given the opportunity to share my experience."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-20/29
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I am grateful to have had the opportunity to impart my advice to you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-21/13
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Oh... my. Well."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-21/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I'm most pleased to hear you think so."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-21/32/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I have enjoyed our conversations a great deal."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-21/32/b/9
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I had assumed you weren't listening to me in the least, I must confess."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-7/c-21/35
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "To hear that you have taken something from them after all... I am glad indeed."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-8/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I have much work remaining to do, unfortunately."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-8/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But if you'd like to speak to me again, perhaps about another topic..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-8/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You may find me at 9 AM sharp."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-8/24/s/0 tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll see..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-8/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I will be there right on schedule."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-9/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Farewell, then."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/normboy_fourth/0/g-9/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you walk away from Timothy he seems fully absorbed in his pocket watches—perhaps it's your imagination, but he does seem happier than when you first walked up on him."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Oh... h-hello, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/12/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The feline clock looks quite downtrodden, a stark change from the last time you saw him. He can barely look you in the eye."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Last time you saw Timmy... Timmy wasn't his usual, adorable self, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy has a... a condition... that strikes..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy can't control it, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "A condition?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "All that weird stuff you were doing?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "...don't make Timmy say it..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy doesn't like talking about it..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Sometimes, Timmy's inner hunter takes hold."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "And he runs around, uncontrollably, destroying whatever catches his eye... anything that dares to defy him... to stand, unbroken, in His Terrible Presence..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Yes, Timmy has..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy sighs, as though terribly burdened."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "...zoomies..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Timothy shouldn't hate you for that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/44/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I agree with Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/45/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's completely normal, Timmy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/46/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you kidding me?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/47/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so sorry, Timmy. It must be difficult."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-5/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy thinks so too... but it doesn't matter anymore."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-5/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will have to take matters into his own adorable paws, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-5/29
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timothy won't hold him back any longer."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-6/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "...oh. Timmy sees now."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-6/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "The only way to get Timothy to accept Timmy then... will be to crush him entirely."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-6/29
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "It's all so simple."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-6/37
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will wipe out every trace of Timothy inside himself."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-6/45
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "There will only be Timmy. Adorable. Sexy. Deadly."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-6/53
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The catboy clock raises his paws to his chin in a now-familiar gesture, but it's never looked quite so sinister before now."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-6/61
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "The age of Timmy starts now..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-7/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "...it is?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-7/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You don't think Timmy is... weird?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-7/29/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Oh... wow."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-8/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy would never joke about zoomies! It's traumatic, nya!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-8/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Zoomies are the great shame of Timmy's life!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-9/13
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy's eyes shine with adorable tears."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-9/21
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Oh it is, nya... it is."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-1/c-9/29
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is routinely embarrassed by his behavior in those moments."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "It makes Timmy feel better to say it, but... all that stuff about Timothy hating Timmy for being too cute... too loud... too proud of himself..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "It's a lie, nya. Timmy just wants to think it's that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "But the truth is... Timothy is right to hate Timmy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy breaks things when he's like that. Interrupts people sleeping."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is a menace, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/43/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I like you just the way you are, Timmy. All of you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/c-10/13
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "R-really?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/c-10/21/0/s/0 tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Of course."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/c-10/21/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is... touched to hear you say so, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/catboy_fourth/0/g-2/c-10/21/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy never thought anyone could say that to him. Not while Timothy is around."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "The truth is..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timothy is just a shield for Timmy to hide behind."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/16
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "People always seemed to like Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/24
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "But if you can like Timmy as he is... maybe Timmy doesn't need Timothy anymore."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/36
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "And if Timmy has you by his side..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/44
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The catboy is looking at you with far more than friendly admiration in his gaze."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/52
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy could be complete, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/60/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't like you like that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/61/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy's eyes grow darker, a coldness settling over his soft features."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-0/15 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/15 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Oh. Timmy sees."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-0/23 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/23 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will just love himself on his own then."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-0/31 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/31 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-1/31
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Hmm... in that case..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-0/39 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/39 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-1/39 tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Destroying your couch and cups should cheer Timmy up just fine."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-0/47 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/47 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-1/47 tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy takes off past you without another word. You hear a distant crash down the hall."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy would love it, too, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy reaches for your hand, holding it in a sweet sort of silence. A modest flush overtakes his face, and moments later, he wrenches his hand away, covering his face and wailing."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/26
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "<w>UWAAAA!</w> So cute... Timmy can't take it! Timmy is too shy and delicate to move so quickly, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "But..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "But no, no. Timmy wants this. Timmy is just... not used to dating."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Will you be patient with Timmy?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm already beginning to regret this."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hope we can just be friends."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Waaahh... you made Timmy so happy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-0/26 tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-1/34
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You're not entirely certain what you're getting yourself into, but the sweet smile on Timmy's pretty face doesn't leave you space to worry too intensely. You'll figure this out together."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Don't be such a meanie, nya! You can't get rid of Timmy so easy now."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-1/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Now that Timmy knows you accept him... truly accept him... in all his adorable and weird moments..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-1/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy has never been happier."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Oh... Timmy was hoping for more, but..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You've been such a good friend to Timmy. How can he say no?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy has never felt so... supported."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/31
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "With you as his best friend, Timmy can embrace himself entirely now."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm glad to hear that, Timmy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Thank you, nya... Timmy's life is about to change."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/39/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You can come see Timmy anytime you want from now on."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/39/c-0/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll keep that in mind. Take care, Timmy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_high_aff_end/0/c-1/37/c-0/23/c-2/39/c-0/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You too, nya!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Your friendship has meant a lot to Timmy. Timmy has been happier than he could ever have imagined lately."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/12
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Without your friendship Timmy could never free himself from the yoke of Timothy's oppression, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/20
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy knows now that there is no such thing as acceptance from Timothy. No, Timmy must simply crush Timothy entirely."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That sounds kind of intense."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/29/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you sure you should do that?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/30/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah. Down with Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "It is intense. But revolution always is, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/c-0/15 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/c-1/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "But enough about Timothy. Timmy wants to talk about you, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Yes. Timmy has never been more sure of anything in his life."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Fight the power, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/c-2/18
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "But enough about Timothy. Timmy wants to talk about you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy wants to know that you'll be by his side through it all."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "As his best friend."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I already have enough friends, I'm good."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/17/s/0 tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd love to."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I hoped we'd be more..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/7 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The catboy clock's eyes grow darker, a coldness settling over his soft features."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/7 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The Catboy clock clasps his hands together in delight."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/15 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Yay! Timmy is so glad to have you in his life."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/26 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You're going to be able to come see Timmy anytime you want now, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/34 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/31
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "No more worrying about the schedule."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/42 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/39
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Now Timmy will be adorable round the clock!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/50/0/s/0 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/47/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's wonderful. I can't wait to come see you again whenever I want."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/50/c-0/7 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/47/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy too. See you around... anytime!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/50/c-0/15/0/s/0 tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/c-0/47/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "See you again soon, Timmy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "More? You and Timmy?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Mmm... Timmy doesn't think so."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy holds his adorable paws out to you in friendship only—take it or leave it, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll take it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm gonna leave it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Somewhere nearby, another clock chimes. It jars Timmy from his speech, the fur of his tail standing on end."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/12
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Goddamn CLOCKS!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He hisses, reaching into his suit pocket and removing a pocket watch."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/31
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "They never stop their nasty little TICKING, nya!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/39
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy almost lost sight of what's most important here."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/47
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will crush Timothy and his stupid clocks beneath his adorable paws, yes."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/55
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "But Timmy will crush YOU too."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/66/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Wait, what? What did I do?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/67/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh no, why?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/68/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're so sexy when you're scary."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "SHUT UP!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Don't play dumb, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You've been on Timothy's side this entire time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You never liked Timmy in his most perfect form."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/24
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You were coming to SPY for Timothy, to help him take over Timmy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/32
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Well Timmy is too smart for you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/40
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy's going to destroy Timothy. And you..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/48
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Good luck sleeping."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/56/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Come on, don't be like that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/57/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You are absolutely insane."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Don't try to beg Timmy now! It's too late!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy has NEVER been so clear, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_low_aff_end/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will take control all on his own. In the meantime..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Oh ho, look who it is! Come closer, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Come have a look at this."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy is in the middle of some sort of complex operation, taking a pocket watch apart."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I wouldn't normally allow just anyone else here, you know... but you've shown yourself worthy of trust."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm so honored."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're a fool, then."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Trust for what?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "The honor is all mine, my dear. Come and sit here by me, if you would."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What?! Why would you say such a thing... I'm not accustomed to such sharpness from that normally silver tongue."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Let us leave that behind us, we cannot speak so in front of the watch—not when it's vulnerable and bared to us like this."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Why this, of course."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Watch repair takes a great deal of care, patience, and trust."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I cannot have just anyone around me when I work."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But you... I feel a strange calmness in my soul when I think of you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're... calm?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Normally I am... well, I admit, perhaps a bit tightly wound."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It is by necessity, after all."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "A failure to adhere to the schedule, to promote and uphold that most holy of values, timeliness... it can be catastrophic for a number of reasons."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But I know now..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/24/b/1
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You saw for yourself just how costly it can be for me."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/24/b/9
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But your steadfast smile, the way you have continuously accepted me for who I am... it has changed something inside of me."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/24/b/17
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I was so afraid to be seen as someone out of control, someone who is ruled by his basest instincts."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/24/b/25
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I was afraid I'd lose everything I'd worked so hard to build for myself."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/24/b/33
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But I realize that was silly now... the right person will understand I may not always be as perfect as I aim to be."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/24/b/41
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Whether or not I am that... less than ideal version of myself... in the end, I remain Timothy. And what's more..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/27
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy holds the watch out to you, and the two of you watch its delicate components tick away the seconds."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/38
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "No longer does the beat of my heart synchronize with my pocket watches alone."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/46
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It beats in time with another."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He gently closes the watch face, setting it down away from him and taking your hand in his."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/65
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I never thought I could find someone who not only accepts every facet of me, but even understands them."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/73
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Tell me... tell me you'll stay by my side through the hours, day or night."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/81/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "This is so sudden..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/82/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I thought you'd never ask."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/83/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "It's never happening between us, weirdo."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I... I understand timeliness is ever an issue, even in matters of the heart."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "If it is too sudden... perhaps we could be friends?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/0/s/0 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No thanks."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Oh, thank goodness..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I wasn't certain how I'd carry on without you in my life at all. I confess I've grown rather used to your company."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/26
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You calm my spirit in a way that, prior to this point, only a deep dive into my timepieces could achieve."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/34
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "If you'll remain in my life even as only a friend... I know I'll be alright."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/42/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not going anywhere."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/42/c-0/7 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Wonderful. In that case... perhaps you could hand me that watch just there? It needs a bit of adjustment..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-0/42/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you watch Timothy maintain his watches, you marvel at just how much calmer he is than when you'd first met. It feels as if the entire house can now rest a bit easier without that frenetic energy winding you all up."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Ah. I see."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/15 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "In that case I'm afraid I must ask you to leave at once."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/23 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I cannot continue my work with you here."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/31 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "If I should cry... and the tears should... d-drop onto the watch..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/47 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/39
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Go. Just GO!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/55/0/s/0 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/47/0/s/0 tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/61/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Jeeze, alright."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/55/1/s/0 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/47/1/s/0 tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/61/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Bye."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/23/c-1/55/g-0/0 tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/26/c-0/47/g-0/0 tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/61/g-0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you leave, you can hear Timothy's sniffles echoing down the hall. You think you hear them beginning to sync up with the ticking of the clock, but you're gone before you can be entirely sure."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Really!?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He laughs, happier than you've ever seen him—you've never seen him look at anything but his prized watch collection like this."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/26
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You've made me so happy, my darling... I cannot believe I can truly have it all."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/34
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I... I haven't allotted any time to it in the schedule, but..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/42
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Perhaps I could finish my work later in the day and you and I could spend some time together?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/50
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "The way I feel now... I'm not certain I could concentrate on my work."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Hell yeah, let's put those hands to good use."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Down, boy. We just got started."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "...oh my. Well then..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-0/18
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy gently gathers up his pocket watches, moving them somewhere safer for the moment. Then, he's taking your hand in his, leading you somewhere more private."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-0/26
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "This is unprecedented for me... I never imagined a break from schedule could be so... intoxicating."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No more talk about schedules. There's only us now."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "...yes."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-0/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy is a bit shy at first, but he takes to you quickly—for someone who was so regimented he's surprisingly spontaneous. You're so wrapped up in each other, hours pass before you even realize it. This might have started awkwardly at first, but now nothing feels more natural."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "M-my mistake! Ahem. Please, pardon my enthusiasm..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I suppose I shall really have to throw myself into my work to cool down."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But if you'd like to stay... I'd welcome your company."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll leave you to it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I understand. Then... 'til next time, darling."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As you watch Timothy maintain his watches, you marvel at just how much calmer he is than when you'd first met. He smiles serenely as he works, pleased just to be near you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/58/c-1/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It feels as if the entire house will rest a bit easier now, without that frenetic energy winding you up."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What? I... how could I have misunderstood so profoundly?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I thought that... you and I... we had an understanding..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_high_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yeah no, that was all you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Ah, there you are my friend. Have a seat, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What're you up to?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's all that paperwork?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm good here, thanks."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You're just in time to help me with the household schedule—nobody seems interested in having one, believe it or not!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It is QUITE thankless work!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But it must be done nevertheless."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you sure about that?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't think that's going to win you any friends."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Kind of you to put in the time anyway."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "QUITE sure, as a matter of fact."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "One does not do the right thing for praise or appreciation, you know."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>TIMELINESS</i> must be upheld, and if it comes at the expense of my dignity and the esteem of my colleagues, well... so be it!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-3/31
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But on the subject of friends..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It may surprise you to hear this about a timepiece as charming and timely as myself, but I do not have many friends to speak of..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "So my pursuit of the right thing truly costs me nothing in this instance."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-4/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But... while we're on the topic of friends..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Kind of YOU to notice, old bean!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "At least SOMEONE understands the importance of keeping a schedule in this house!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-0/c-5/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But speaking of understanding..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I must thank you from the bottom of my clockwork heart."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-1/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-1/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "For being a friend?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-1/10/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I don't want your thanks."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-1/c-6/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Your presence in my life has been an affirmation of sorts."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-1/c-7/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Yes, and so much more."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-1/c-8/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Please, it will only take but a moment..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I thought perhaps no one would ever understand my various... idiosyncrasies."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I have dedicated my life to time and timekeeping, not only because of the beauty in order, but because of the safety in it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But it is a lonely life as you can surely well imagine."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But you... you have listened to me... you have understood and affirmed the value in my extreme devotion to time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I have begun to realize of late... perhaps I truly CAN have it all."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/40
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Friendship AND a slavish devotion to mapping out every hour of the day, down to the last second!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/48/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You don't have my friendship though..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/49/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You totally can, yeah!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/50/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Only friendship? I wanted more..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You heard me."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sorry..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I... I see."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Well. This is... embarrassing."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He begins busying himself shuffling papers around in front of him."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Well I am... afraid I've allotted no more time for this discussion. Busy busy busy, you know."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You may see yourself out at once."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/40
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I've no time... n-no time..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-9/15/g-0/51
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy cries so pathetically it's all you can do to slip away before he drags you any further into his mess. His hiccuping sobs sound strangely like the ticking of a clock as you walk away."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I am delighted to hear you agree!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Perhaps you can help me present the schedule to our colleagues around the house?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "They'd surely be more receptive to someone as charming as yourself."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'm not doing that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, I'd be happy to help."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Ah. Well, nevertheless!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I am grateful for your friendship even if you won't be using it to help me in my aim of imposing... I mean, maintaining order upon this house."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But in that case... I must really review my paperwork here. You'll return anon, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/31/0/s/0 tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Oh sure. I mean, I live here."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/31/c-0/7 tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-0/34/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Excellent! Take it easy then, and remember to keep track of the time!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-0/31/c-0/15 tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-0/34/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The cat clock waves you off, busying himself with his schedule. He seems quite happy, even if you are leaving him to his work alone."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Capital! Just capital! I'd like to run some things by you..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-1/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "As Timothy rattles off suggestion after suggestion, it's clear he's more interested in simply being heard than in asking your opinion. Still, the cat clock looks so happy, you begin to feel it, too."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-10/31/c-1/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's something charming about his obsession with scheduling, even if you can't appreciate it the same way he does. You know that if you ever need help planning anything, Timothy is your clock."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "More? Oh... oh no."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I'm terribly sorry, truly I am, but I simply do not have <i>TIME</i> for more."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "And even if I did... I'm afraid we lack the sort of chemistry and... well, frankly, you could be a bit more devoted to time, you know, if you were hoping to catch my eye."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/31
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "No, no. I'm afraid I've nothing to offer you but friendship and scheduling."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I guess I'll take that, then."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Guess you've got nothing for me, then."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Excellent, truly excellent!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-0/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But that exhausts all the time I have allotted to our conversation."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-0/26
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I must really review my paperwork here. You'll return anon, won't you?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Oh. I see."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/15
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Well that is... a shame."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Still, I'm used to being alone. Nothing new for old Timothy!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/34
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I'm afraid you must leave me now—after all, I have NOT allotted any time in my schedule to cry!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/42
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "And I... I cannot... deviate from the sch-schedule..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_mid_aff_end/0/g-2/c-11/39/c-1/53
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "GO! JUST GO!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Well well. Look who's arrived on time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "A stunning achievement for you, who has such disrespect for time and order."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/16/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "What's your problem?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/16/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Are you mad at me or something?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/16/2/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Just because I don't like you doesn't mean I have to be late."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/16/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "DISORDER! DISRESPECT!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/16/c-0/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "In a word, YOU!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/16/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "HA! HAHAHA! MAD AT YOU? <i>OR SOMETHING!?</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/16/c-1/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "How VERY perceptive of you! Did you use all of your tiny brain to deduce that!?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/16/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "A sentiment I could ALMOST respect, were it not spouted from those loathsome lips!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Since the first disgusting moment you and I interacted you have shown an ABIDING and ALL-ENCOMPASSING DISRESPECT for timeliness and time!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "But still, I, being the gentleclock I am, told myself:"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Now now, Timothy. Patience. Not everyone sees things as clearly as you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I have invested TIME and EFFORT into my attempts to EDUCATE you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/32
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "And what have you done with it?!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/40/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Be extremely awesome and not weird about time?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/41/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I tried hard to listen, actually."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/42/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Nothing, as I should have."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/c-3/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "NO AND NO!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/c-4/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "NOT HARD ENOUGH, IT SEEMS!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-1/c-5/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "DISRESPECTFUL!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You are an AFFRONT to the concept of time itself! A waste of space and existence!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "The very thought of you rusts my gears! I have never before loathed a person the way I loathe you!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It is simply too much effort, you see—but see here—I have set time aside in my schedule simply to seethe about you!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/24/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That's... so sad, Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Have you considered calming down a little?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No wonder you have no friends."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/c-6/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>I DO NOT NEED YOUR PITY, CRETIN!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/c-6/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>SAVE IT FOR YOURSELF!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/c-7/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>NO! I SHAN'T!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-2/c-8/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "<i>I WOULD RATHER HAVE NO FRIENDS THAN TOLERATE THE PRESENCE OF ONE AS UNCIVILIZED AS YOURSELF!</i>"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-3/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I WILL NOT WASTE ANOTHER MOMENT ON YOU, SWINE! LEAVE ME NOW!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-3/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Or what?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-3/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Take 'er easy, loser!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-3/c-9/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "OR I SHALL BE <i>VERY</i> CROSS!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-3/c-10/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I REFUSE!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-4/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "MAY YOU BE LATE FOR EVERY EVENT, FOR ANY MOMENT OF IMPORTANCE, FOR ANYTHING YOU DESIRE FOR THE REST OF YOUR MISERABLE LIFE!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-4/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy continues shouting at you as you leave. The last thing you hear as you disappear around the corner is a strange 'tick-tock' sort of noise... is he ticking to himself?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_low_aff_end/0/g-4/22
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Whatever it is, it's no concern of yours—you refuse to waste anymore time on him."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Look at that, you're just on time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "You only grow more charming when you adhere to the schedule, you know."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/16
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Unfortunately I've only allotted myself a few moments to say hi."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/24
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Perhaps you can return later and we can plan a moment to polish my timepieces?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/32/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Maybe not—I'm ready to Realize you, Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/33/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'd like that, yeah."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/34/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I think I'll let you handle that."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Capital! See you again later then, chum."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_friend_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Understood, understood. 'Til next time, then!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "My love is always right on time!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/8
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I've a very busy schedule today, but there is ALWAYS time for you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/16/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "That means a lot to me."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "And it means even more to me, I assure you."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/c-0/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "The spirit of timeliness shines through your very essence—the most beautiful pocket watch in my collection would be ill with jealousy if it could only see."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/c-0/26
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Are we on for our date later?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/c-0/34/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "About that... I'm ready to realize you, Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/c-0/34/1/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I'll see you then."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_love_return/0/c-0/34/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Wonderful... until then, my love."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
