#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, why not."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "YAYYY! Timmy is so happy..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/c-0/18
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Hurry back with gifts for Timmy later, okay?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Sure, sure. Later then."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/c-0/26/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Byeeee!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Aww... pweeease?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "We'll SEE."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-1/23/c-1/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Booo, nya!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-2/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Yaaaay! Just take this string, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-2/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You dangle the string Timmy gives you, watching him jump around after it like a madman. He's much larger than a housecat, but somehow he's just as captivating."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_friend_return/0/c-2/23
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You pass the time pleasantly, playing with the string together far longer than you thought you would."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "How DARE you show your loathsome face to me."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/8/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Don't be like that, Timothy. I'm sorry. (USE SMARTS CANDY)"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/9/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I dare... and I will again!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Hmph."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The catboy clock looks you over with a suspicious gaze. After a few moments he seems to relax."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I am so very tired of holding a grudge. It eats up far too much time in the schedule."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Perhaps it is time for a new beginning."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-0/39/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I'll do better this time, I promise. Can we just be cool again?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-0/39/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "...I would like that, yes. Let us start anew as friends."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-0/39/c-0/15/0/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Thank you... I'm glad we can leave all that behind us."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-0/39/c-0/15/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "As am I. Take care... friend."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/clock_hate_return/0/c-1/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Most loathsome!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/tim_hate_joiner/34 tim_clock/timmy_hate_joiner/38
msgctxt "Reggie"
msgid "Time's up!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Realization!? Truly?!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_join/0/18/s/0 tim_clock/timothy_realize_return/0/18/s/0 tim_clock/timmy_realize_return/0/26/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, not just yet."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Cruel to get one's hopes up, you know!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "I shall pencil in 'Realization' to the schedule—but do return when you are <i>actually</i> ready."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Well? Is it finally time for Realization?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_return/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I have what it takes. It's time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Oh, for the love of all things, timely! Gah! Ah! Please return when it is actually time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_begin/3/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Our first Realization will be coming right on shhedule!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_begin/6
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "It's time - let's do this Timothy Timepiece!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realize_begin/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a clock, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy turns around, examining his newly human body. His tail and ears are just where they were, but the body they adorn is fully human now."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/11
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "No gears... no internal tick-tock-ticking."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/19
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Only the lub-dub-lub-dub of a human heart..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/27/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You'll have to keep time on your own now, Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/28/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "I want to feel your heartbeat, Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Yes, I suppose I shall."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He gives you a warm smile."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "A challenge I shall embrace whole-heartedly."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_realized/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Thank you for this gift, my friend. I shan't forget it."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy's amazement melts away into a gentle warmth, and he takes your hand in his, placing it on his chest."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You can feel a strong heartbeat beneath, regular, entirely human..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "And only speeding up the longer your hand rests on his chest."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/27
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Does it always feel like this?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/38
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "His hand comes up to rest over yours. He presses your fingers into his chest until his heartbeat is all you can think about."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/46
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "It's not like the ticking of a clock at all, is it? It speeds and slows..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/54
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "And when you touch me like this... I... words are not enough."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "For once, Timothy is speechless. When you take his hand and lead him away he follows you, starry-eyed and eager to see what comes next."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/70
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "There's no more talk of schedules or clocks now—there's only you and Timothy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/78
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Time falls away when you're in each other's arms; you're not even sure how long it's been."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/89
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's not until you see the first rays of the morning sun that you realize you've been together all night."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_divert/97
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy vows to visit you regularly on a schedule. He also assures you that he will try to embrace a less regimented life now that he's human."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy tries to move away from his obsession with time and scheduling. He picks up some odd jobs here and there, but the obsession runs too deep, and he quits every one of them."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "No one is ever quite on time—he just can't cope."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's not until he goes to work at your local train station that he finds a place he can truly excel."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Here Timothy's obsessive devotion to schedule, and fondness for pocketwatches, sets him apart in the best way. In an orderly fashion, he works his way up to train conductor. But he doesn't stop there."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/32
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He revolutionizes your municipal train system, transforming delays from a consistent occurrence to a rare event."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/40
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "The next train will arrive at the station in 5 minutes!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/48
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "There are so few things in this life one can count on—but you can be sure our trains are one!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/56
msgctxt "Timothy"
msgid "Please line up in an orderly fashion! Remember: there is always time for courtesy!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timothy_love_join/64
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy's love for timeliness has changed the game for commuters in your city—you can't help but smile when you see photos of him in his conductor's uniform. He's come so far."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_join/0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Realization? For Timmy?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_join/0/17/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, for you. I'm ready."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_join/0/18/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "No, sorry, not yet."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_join/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Oh... you got Timmy's hopes up, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_join/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will wait for you. Come back when you're really gonna do it!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_return/0/0
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Are you done playing with Timmy's feelings?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_return/0/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Is it Realization time, nya?"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_return/0/25/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "Yes, I'm ready this time."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_return/0/c-1/10
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Stop hurting Timmy's feelings!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_return/0/c-1/18
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Come back when you're serious, nya!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_begin/3/b/1
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Our first Realization is Timmy? Skylar afraid."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_begin/6
msgctxt "Skylar"
msgid "Come on, Timmy, time for walkies!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realize_begin/17
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "The spectral energy flows through your dateviators, and what was once merely a cat-boy clock, becomes...."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy's reaction is surprisingly subdued—he only yawns and stretches."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/8
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is human now... but he still feels like himself."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/16
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "No more clocks inside... no more tick-tick-tick."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/24
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy is cuter than ever now that he's a real boy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/35/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You look adorable."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/36/s/0
msgctxt "Choix"
msgid "You're just as perfect as you've always been, my love."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/c-0/7
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy knows it, nya."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/c-0/15
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Thanks for believing in Timmy, even when mean old Timothy wouldn't..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/c-0/23
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "It's time for Timmy to take his cuteness out there and conquer the world."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/c-0/31
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "He'll save you a spot in his empire of cute as thanks for your service."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_realized/0/c-0/39
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Ta ta, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_divert/3
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timothy's long lashes flutter in your direction, and then he's coming closer, his voice a smooth purr."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_divert/11
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "You've always seen Timmy for who he is, even when the world was against him."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_divert/19
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Even when his own self tried to keep him trapped."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_divert/27
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Timmy will always appreciate you for that, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_divert/35
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Let Timmy show you just how much..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_divert/43
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy's lazy catboy nature belies a passionate side—behind closed doors he comes alive, showing a sweetness and sensuality you hadn't expected."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_divert/54
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "It's hard to believe this is the same catboy you once caught zooming around your hallways, massacring your yarn and terrorizing his straight-laced alter ego."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_divert/62
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "He wakes you far too early in the morning by sitting on your face—and then has the nerve to nap the rest of the day away, bidding you farewell as he sets out in the evening."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_join/0
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "You hear nothing from Timmy for weeks. You were beginning to worry, but it becomes clear that human though he may be, Timmy simply comes and goes on his own schedule—like a true catboy."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_join/8
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Work doesn't suit Timmy; he doesn't even bother trying to find a job, because he's had enough of being told what to do for the rest of his life."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_join/16
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Praise, however, suits Timmy just fine. He receives it easily for his laid-back philosophy and his cuteness, and soon a cult of sorts pops up around him."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_join/24
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "Timmy shrewdly milks this for all it's worth, landing an apartment, furniture, and a steady supply of tuna. When he creates his first social media profile, it goes viral, and many new followers mistake him for a cosplayer."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_join/32
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Are Timmy's ears real? What a rude question, nya..."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_join/40
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "What do you mean how did Timmy make this tail? This is Timmy's tail!"
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_join/48
msgctxt "Timmy"
msgid "Cosplay tutorial? Timmy doesn't know what that is and doesn't want to know."
msgstr ""

#: tim_clock/timmy_love_join/56
msgctxt "Narrator"
msgid "A few months later you see Timmy's face on a famous brand of tuna, ousting their former fish mascot. You have to marvel at just how far this catboy has gotten on literally nothing but charisma."
msgstr ""
